      "line_end": 17,
      "title": "Removed throw breaks the outside-a-repository check",
      "description": "currentBranch returns null outside a repository only because safeGit used to throw when git failed. safeGit now catches the failure and returns a non-zero code instead. Once the callers read stdout, currentBranch returns an empty string outside a repository and never returns null. main.ts then skips its not a git repository exit and continues with bad data. Make currentBranch return null when result.code is not 0. Make changedFiles handle a non-zero code too.",
